reading `a`, an arrangement of two movers whose disparities are BOTH strictly greater than `a` (no upper threshold) lands at the first lonely
instant, with the cascade sequence.  Same conclusion as `S2Clean_All`.  Grades: [L]; [PROVISIONAL: covering] (existence of a common clear instant in some
